# The framing check's positive control, and following's rules ("Follow while
# playing", 2026-10-03). Under Still, which holds every body where it is, the
# fixture frames. A pan stops the camera following, so a node planted 4,000 px
# off the canvas stays off it and the check counts exactly that node: a law
# receipt's `layout-outside == 0` fails on that frame. Fit graph resumes
# following, and the view takes the planted node in.
assert title GRAPHSHELL H3 READY
assert snap ready == true
dom click [data-command="physics:toggle"]
settle 1
assert snap physics-paused == false
select #gs-arrangement-select free
dom click [data-command="apply-arrangement"]
settle 1
assert snap layout == free
select #gs-physics-select still.default
dom click [data-command="apply-physics"]
settle 1
assert snap physics-law == still.default
settle 60
assert snap view-follow == true
assert snap canvas-nodes == 11
assert snap layout-outside == 0
dom click [data-command="pan-left"]
settle 30
assert snap view-follow == false
assert snap layout-outside == 0
add-node 4000 300 mere://frame/control
settle 1
assert snap canvas-nodes == 12
settle 60
assert snap view-follow == false
assert snap layout-outside == 1
capture physics_framing_planted
wait
act view:fit
settle 60
assert snap view-follow == true
assert snap layout-outside == 0
capture physics_framing_fitted
wait
log physics framing control complete
